• Exposure to application servers, web servers, Unix environments and command-line operations. &nbsp;

• Interest in AI-enabled delivery automation or tools that improve implementation efficiency. &nbsp;

What success looks like &nbsp;

• Clients receive reliable, well-tested implementation deliverables that meet approved requirements. &nbsp;

